1
00:00:00,329 --> 00:00:02,539
(Sheldon:)Your heart might be
in the right place,

2
00:00:02,698 --> 00:00:04,978
(Sheldon:)but your head, chest
and arms certainly aren't.

3
00:00:07,203 --> 00:00:09,153
Anyway, the funeral's on Sunday.

4
00:00:09,305 --> 00:00:11,685
(Sheldon:)But, that's Star Wars Day.

5
00:00:11,841 --> 00:00:13,881
(Leonard:)Yeah...

6
00:00:14,043 --> 00:00:16,323
(Leonard:)Of all the things about this
that are sad,

7
00:00:16,479 --> 00:00:18,389
(Leonard:)that might not be number one.

8
00:00:20,716 --> 00:00:22,886
You OK?
I know he meant a lot to you.

9
00:00:23,986 --> 00:00:24,986
(Sheldon:)I'm fine.

10
00:00:26,689 --> 00:00:27,999
(Howard:)OK.

11
00:00:29,825 --> 00:00:33,205
(Leonard:)Yet he cried when they changed
the Raisin Bran box.

12
00:00:35,197 --> 00:00:38,197
(Professor Proton(on youtube):)This is something
interesting, boys and girls.

13
00:00:38,367 --> 00:00:42,177
(Professor Proton(on youtube):)After an owl eats,
he spits up part of his meal,

14
00:00:42,338 --> 00:00:45,748
that he cant digest,
in the form of a pellet.

15
00:00:48,878 --> 00:00:51,048
(Professor Proton(on youtube):)Is.... isn't that a hoot?

16
00:00:55,084 --> 00:00:59,024
(Professor Proton(on youtube):)We'll be right back
after I fire my writers.

